#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.9.0"
msgstr "v2.9.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.9.0 introduces initial **FLIR Lepton** thermal-camera module support "
"(Lepton SDK, module-ID detection, 16-bit camera-bus register addressing) and"
" switches windowing to software cropping for more reliable DMA transfers. "
"The :func:`sensor.snapshot` ``line_filter`` keyword was removed — read the "
"breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v2.9.0 memperkenalkan dukungan awal modul kamera termal **FLIR Lepton** "
"(Lepton SDK, deteksi ID modul, pengalamatan register bus kamera 16-bit) dan "
"beralih dari windowing ke cropping perangkat lunak untuk transfer DMA yang "
"lebih andal. Kata kunci ``line_filter`` dari :func:`sensor.snapshot` telah "
"dihapus — baca perubahan yang tidak kompatibel di bawah."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:20
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — initial thermal-camera module support (Lepton SDK, module-"
"ID detection)."
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — dukungan awal modul kamera termal (Lepton SDK, deteksi ID "
"modul)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**16-bit camera-bus registers** — supports sensors (like the Lepton) with "
"16-bit register addresses."
msgstr ""
"**Register bus kamera 16-bit** — mendukung sensor (seperti Lepton) dengan "
"alamat register 16-bit."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Software cropping** — windowing now uses software cropping for more "
"reliable DMA transfer sizes."
msgstr ""
"**Cropping perangkat lunak** — windowing kini menggunakan cropping perangkat"
" lunak untuk ukuran transfer DMA yang lebih andal."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the :func:`sensor.snapshot` ``line_filter`` keyword was "
"removed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Perubahan tidak kompatibel:** kata kunci ``line_filter`` dari "
":func:`sensor.snapshot` telah dihapus — lihat perubahan yang tidak "
"kompatibel."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:30
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — added the FLIR Lepton module, Lepton SDK, Lepton module-ID"
" support, and the ability for sensors to override the default snapshot "
"function (so the Lepton can provide its own capture path)."
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — ditambahkan modul FLIR Lepton, Lepton SDK, dukungan ID "
"modul Lepton, dan kemampuan sensor untuk mengganti fungsi snapshot default "
"(sehingga Lepton dapat menyediakan jalur pengambilan gambarnya sendiri)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:35
msgid "**Camera bus** — added 16-bit register-address support."
msgstr "**Bus kamera** — ditambahkan dukungan alamat register 16-bit."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:38
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"Switched from DCMI hardware cropping to software cropping (fixing issues "
"with some DMA transfer sizes), moved ``bayer_to_rgb565`` into ``imlib``, and"
" added the WINC SPI prescaler to the board configuration files."
msgstr ""
"Beralih dari cropping hardware DCMI ke cropping perangkat lunak (memperbaiki"
" masalah dengan beberapa ukuran transfer DMA), memindahkan "
"``bayer_to_rgb565`` ke dalam ``imlib``\\ , dan menambahkan prescaler WINC "
"SPI ke file konfigurasi board."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:45
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"Fixed SD-card issues (disabled the USB IRQ during non-DMA SD transfers), "
"JPEG Bayer bounds, and added a sensor window-size check."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki masalah kartu SD (menonaktifkan IRQ USB selama transfer SD non-"
"DMA), batas Bayer JPEG, dan menambahkan pemeriksaan ukuran jendela sensor."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:51
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Dukungan hardware dan board"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:53
msgid "**FLIR Lepton** thermal-camera module (initial support)."
msgstr "Modul kamera termal **FLIR Lepton** (dukungan awal)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:56
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang tidak kompatibel"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:58
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v2.8.0 and v2.9.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan API yang terlihat pengguna antara v2.8.0 dan v2.9.0. Cakupan: "
"modul C Python di ``modules/`` dan pustaka Python di "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:61
msgid ""
"The breaking change is *minor* and only affects scripts that used the "
"``line_filter`` snapshot keyword. Each commit hash links to its diff on "
"GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan yang tidak kompatibel bersifat *minor* dan hanya memengaruhi skrip"
" yang menggunakan kata kunci snapshot ``line_filter``\\ . Setiap hash commit"
" terhubung ke diff-nya di GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:68
msgid ":func:`sensor.snapshot` ``line_filter`` keyword removed *(minor)*"
msgstr ""
"Kata kunci ``line_filter`` dari :func:`sensor.snapshot` dihapus *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:70
msgid ""
"The ``line_filter`` keyword argument (a per-line filter callback) was "
"removed from :func:`sensor.snapshot`. Scripts that passed "
"``sensor.snapshot(line_filter=...)`` must drop that argument and perform any"
" per-line processing on the returned image instead."
msgstr ""
"Argumen kata kunci ``line_filter`` (callback filter per baris) telah dihapus"
" dari :func:`sensor.snapshot`\\ . Skrip yang meneruskan "
"``sensor.snapshot(line_filter=...)`` harus menghapus argumen tersebut dan "
"melakukan pemrosesan per baris pada citra yang dikembalikan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:75
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `f7e691e39 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f7e691e39>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `f7e691e39 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f7e691e39>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:80
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Daftar periksa migrasi"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:82
msgid ""
"Remove the ``line_filter`` keyword from :func:`sensor.snapshot` calls and "
"process the returned image instead (:ref:`the line_filter removal "
"<v2_9_0_linefilter>`). All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Hapus kata kunci ``line_filter`` dari panggilan :func:`sensor.snapshot` dan "
"proses citra yang dikembalikan sebagai gantinya (\\ :ref:`penghapusan "
"line_filter <v2_9_0_linefilter>`\\ ). Semua skrip lainnya berjalan tanpa "
"perubahan."
